Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-localized-portlet|
		|testray.component.names|Site Localization|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Localization|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-localized-portlet|
		|testray.component.names|Site Localization|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Localization|
		|pageName|Test Localization|
		|portletName|Test Localized Portlet|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|portletName|${portletName}|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Check Localization Chinese
Priority: 4
	Given Click at locator 'TestLocalized#CHINESE_LOCALIZATION'
	When AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_1'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_2'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_3'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_4'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_5'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_6'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_7'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_8'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_9'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_10'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_11'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_12'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_13'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestLocalized#LOCALIZATION_TEST_14'
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'FAILED'
